# Scattered into Shadow (jeuno 61), Tebhi paused from the trade to tebhiGone (clearPath(true): pauseNPCPathing). The
# other flows tick that window in two or three steps, which the trigger's CTriggerState hold (two AI ticks) covers;
# here ticks of 400 ms each: the hold ends 800 ms after the trigger, and then a Tebhi walking his patrol would show in
# a position update each tick. Paused, he shows none but tebhiFade's ('kesu', 2001 ms) until tebhiGone (4001 ms:
# CUTSCENE_ONLY and continuePath).
lists CastleOztroja/Tebhi/onTrade
char zone=CastleOztroja pos=-134.5,24,-21 job=BST lvl=50
quest Jeuno.WingsOfGold completed
quest Jeuno.ScatteredIntoShadow accepted
charvar Quest[3][61]Prog 4
charvar Quest[3][61]Stage 7
item BeastCollar
login                                       # the listener
tick 400                                    # Tebhi NORMAL, 'deru'
trigger Tebhi                               # walk to him
trade Tebhi BeastCollar x1                  # Prog 5, TEBHI_ACCEPTS; clearPath(true), the two timers
tick 400                                    # the trigger's hold
tick 400                                    # the hold's end
tick 400                                    # paused: no position update
tick 400                                    # paused
tick 401                                    # tebhiFade: 'kesu'
tick 400                                    # paused
tick 400                                    # paused
tick 400                                    # paused
tick 400                                    # paused
tick 400                                    # tebhiGone: CUTSCENE_ONLY, continuePath
